{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>You shall not move.</b> It is juxtaposed here, for through moving a boundary disputes, blows, and murder come about, and therefore it is written after it: נפש בנפש, עין בעין. And the claimant who says his fellow moved his boundary against him must bring witnesses for it, therefore it is written: לא יקום עד אחד באיש — for a murderer and for one who moves a boundary and for any matter." "<b>That the first ones bounded.</b> The ones who divided the land."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:53:25.394690661Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}